== Effects ==
* Teleports Isaac to the {{r|Shop}}.

== Notes ==
* Using '''IX - The Hermit''' on a floor that doesn't have a Shop will teleport Isaac to a random room.
* When {{curse|Maze}} is active, using this card can teleport Isaac to a random room instead.
* '''IX - The Hermit''' cannot appear in [[greed mode]].

== Strategy ==
* '''IX - The Hermit''' allows to access the shop without using a key.
* '''IX - The Hermit''' can be used to escape any room that locks down after taking its contents, like {{r|Challenge Room}}s or {{r|Boss Rush}}, effectively "stealing" its contents without facing the imposed challenge.

== Synergies ==
* {{I|Tarot Cloth|r}}: Prevents {{E|Greed}} / {{E|Super Greed}} from spawning in the shop. If Greed was already defeated in the shop, using the card turns it into a normal shop (Does not create a working shop in the [[Mirrored World]]).

== Interactions ==
* {{I|Tarot Cloth|nr}}: No effect.

== Trivia ==
* [[wikipedia:The Hermit (tarot card)|The Hermit]] is the ninth card of a Major Arcana set.
* {{dlc+|r}} There is one room in the game (in {{s|Dross}}) that contains a guaranteed Hermit card (see Gallery). {{dlc-}}

